                                                GBP/USD, USD/JPY, AUD/USD, and over 30 additional pairs. You can
                                                customize which pairs to trade based on your strategy and risk
                                                preferences through the bot's configuration panel.
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="accordion-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay=".6s">
                                        <h5 class="accordion-header">
                                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button"
                                                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq3" aria-expanded="false"
                                                aria-controls="faq3">
                                                How does risk management work?
                                            </button>
                                        </h5>
                                        <div id="faq3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordion">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                The bot includes advanced risk management features including
                                                customizable stop-loss and take-profit levels, maximum drawdown limits,
                                                daily loss limits, and position sizing based on account balance. All
                                                risk parameters can be adjusted to match your trading style and risk
                                                tolerance.
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

